{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1169049-iron-skin-merit","id":1169049,"title":"Iron Skin Merit","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-12-20T04:38:55-08:00","id":1169049,"title":"Iron Skin Merit","content":"The Beast: the Primordial book has a different version of the Merit than the one written in the Chronicles of Darkness core rulebook - is the BtP version a variation of the Merit that is specific to beasts?<br /> <br /> Which one should be used, especially if the Chronicle has a Crossover with other CofD games?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1807-serpent-axis","name":"Serpent Axis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1807_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-20T04:45:23-08:00","id":1169050,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Serpent Axis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1169049-iron-skin-merit#post1169049\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Beast: the Primordial book has a different version of the Merit than the one written in the Chronicles of Darkness core rulebook - is the BtP version a variation of the Merit that is specific to beasts?<br /> <br /> Which one should be used, especially if the Chronicle has a Crossover with other CofD games?</div> </div> </div> </div>Basically, you buy the basic version, then you can buy the Advanced version and then the Epic version. They build on one another. IIRC, the Epic version is unique to Beasts, but the others can be bought by other splats. I'm not sure whether or not the Advanced version can be bought by mortals, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-20T08:38:29-08:00","id":1169096,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1169049-iron-skin-merit?p=1169050#post1169050\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Basically, you buy the basic version, then you can buy the Advanced version and then the Epic version. They build on one another. IIRC, the Epic version is unique to Beasts, but the others can be bought by other splats. I'm not sure whether or not the Advanced version can be bought by mortals, though.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm reasonably certain Axis is talking about the fact that Beast's version of the base Merit has different prerequisites to the one in ChroD Core, which requires two dots in one of two Fighting Styles that each have prerequisites of Brawl 2, two different Attributes at 3, and a second Skill at 2.<br /> <br /> For simplicity's sake, I'd treat the Beast version as a Begotten-specific reduced prerequisite \u2014 the metaphysical qualities of a Beast mean they don't need quite as much investment in combat to toughen themselves against fists and feet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-20T09:02:06-08:00","id":1169103,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1169049-iron-skin-merit?p=1169096#post1169096\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm reasonably certain Axis is talking about the fact that Beast's version of the base Merit has different prerequisites to the one in ChroD Core, which requires two dots in one of two Fighting Styles that each have prerequisites of Brawl 2, two different Attributes at 3, and a second Skill at 2.<br /> <br /> For simplicity's sake, I'd treat the Beast version as a Begotten-specific reduced prerequisite \u2014 the metaphysical qualities of a Beast mean they don't need quite as much investment in combat to toughen themselves against fists and feet.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, my mistake. Sorry.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-20T20:45:23-08:00","id":1169265,"title":"","content":"I'm 95% sure that Iron Skin has different prereqs in Beast simply because they didn't want to include those fighting styles in the merits list, and it would have made no sense to reference styles that weren't in the book. <br /> <br /> That said, the core version prereqs are pretty steep and I don't see any harm using the Beast version if your group is ok with that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5328-helmsderp","name":"HelmsDerp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}